  "limitations": "Synthetic task and frozen random source embeddings. The decoder is shared side information, and the soft reader expands each short code to eight continuous vectors at runtime. The 128-byte figure is a bit-packed payload estimate; this run uses dequantized FP32 values and does not measure packed-kernel latency or runtime memory. Thus this tests compressed storage plus continuous readout, not a constant-size model input or natural-language memory. Only one predeclared offset-4 split and three seeds are evaluated.",
